# --- runs/ tracking policy ---
# Track lightweight artifacts (manifests, rows.parquet, aggregates, figures,
# logs, pilot_manifest, preregistration, probe outputs).
#
# rows.jsonl is tracked via Git LFS (see .gitattributes); the 159 MB raw file
# would otherwise blow past GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard cap.
#
# These exclusions cover everything heavy / transient / re-derivable:
runs/*/prompts/
runs/**/activations/
runs/**/run.lock
runs/**/.run.lock
# Optional NLA reconstruction vectors (~1 GB on full holdout) live on RunPod.
runs/**/reconstructions_vectors.parquet
